    "adapt": "A fenced truck yard on open apron: the host is the weighbridge office (the sales hut). Everything stands on the ground (terrain rows, run town fit --terrain): the lot counter with id truck-yard in front of the hut, a row of four civilian Ural display trucks along the long shed, the spawn bay on the lane west of the counter (set in the lot spawn point, world axes; no cones, the maintainer wants none in town) and two Truck Sales signs. Rows are rigid: shift, never stretch."
